{{Passive skill box|Harmony of Purpose}}

'''Harmony of Purpose''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Guardian]] that passively grants you a random [[shrine]] buff every 10 seconds.

==Mechanics==
The shrine buff has a base duration of 20 seconds. It chooses a Shrine at random and can pick same Shrine multiple times in a row. Having another source of Shrine, like [[Screams of the Desiccated]] does not prevent this type of Shrine to be chosen. Increasing the duration of shrine buffs allows several shrine buffs acquired this way to be active simultaneously. Note that some of the shrine buffs might not apply in all areas, such as low-level campaign areas.

Shrines that are not applied in low-level areas:
Resistance, Resonating, Echoing, Shrouded, Gloom, Divine.

The shrine buff is removed if the source granting it is removed. Shrine buffs do not interact with shrine atlas passives in any way. Shrines persist from zone to zone in acts. In maps, they persist between separate zones like Vaal Side Areas or Mirage Areas. 

Increasing the duration through applicable modifiers allows several shrine buffs acquired this way to be active simultaneously. Increased Shrine effect of [[The Gull]] and [[Blunderbore]] applies.

If this grants the effects of a Freezing, Lightning, or Skeletal Shrine, it will grant their Greater versions instead, which also grants 30% of physical damage as extra cold, lightning, or chaos damage respectively.

